Description: map maker for interactive fiction
 Trizbort (Qt) is a cross-platform reimplementation of Trizbort, a mapper for
 interactive fiction and text adventures. It draws rooms and the connections
 between them, annotates them with descriptions and objects, and exports the
 map as source code for many interactive-fiction systems (ZIL, Inform 6 and 7,
 TADS 3, Hugo, Alan, Quest and Adventuron) or as a PDF or image.
 .
 It can also build a map automatically from a play-session transcript,
 following the player's movements, and it reads and writes the .trizbort file
 format used by the original Trizbort.
